* eda_drv8833 - TI DRV8833 dual H-bridge on a carrier board (part of ai-eda, see LICENSE)
*
* Pins: vin gnd vm slp ai1 ai2 bi1 bi2 ao1 ao2 bo1 bo2
* vin -> vm: the carrier's reverse-protection FET (30 mohm, open while VIN is reversed).
* Each bridge follows the datasheet's logic table: IN1 IN2 = 00 coast (outputs open, the
* body diodes carry the current), 10 forward (OUT1 high, OUT2 low), 01 reverse, 11 brake
* (both low). Inputs are read as the fraction of time they are high, their voltage over
* `logic` (the driving logic's high level), so a PWM input averaged over a co-simulation
* step gives the averaged bridge: with one input held high or low the result is exact
* (slow decay: IN1 high, IN2 PWM; fast decay: IN1 PWM, IN2 low, the off time as coast).
* Time fractions: OUT1 high a(1-b), low b; OUT2 high b(1-a), low a (open for the rest).
* Enabled while nSLEEP is high (above 1.5 V) and VM is above the undervoltage lockout
* (2.6 V). On resistance: high side 200 mohm, low side 160 mohm (VM 5 V, 25 C).
* Not modelled: overcurrent shutdown (2 A minimum per bridge), thermal shutdown, the
* 1 ms wake-up time, and current chopping (ISEN is grounded on the carrier).
*
.subckt eda_drv8833 vin gnd vm slp ai1 ai2 bi1 bi2 ao1 ao2 bo1 bo2
+ params: logic=3.3 rhs=0.2 rls=0.16
Srp vin vm vin gnd swrp
.model swrp sw vt=1.5 vh=0.1 ron=0.03 roff=10Meg
* nSLEEP: pulled up on the carrier, 500 kohm pull-down in the chip.
Rslp_pu slp vm 47k
Rslp_pd slp gnd 500k
* Inputs: 150 kohm pull-downs.
Rai1 ai1 gnd 150k
Rai2 ai2 gnd 150k
Rbi1 bi1 gnd 150k
Rbi2 bi2 gnd 150k
Ben en gnd V = 0.5 * (1 + tanh((v(slp, gnd) - 1.5) / 0.1))
+ * 0.5 * (1 + tanh((v(vm, gnd) - 2.65) / 0.02))
Ren en gnd 1Meg
Bfa1 fa1 gnd V = min(max(v(ai1, gnd) / {logic}, 0), 1)
Bfa2 fa2 gnd V = min(max(v(ai2, gnd) / {logic}, 0), 1)
Bfb1 fb1 gnd V = min(max(v(bi1, gnd) / {logic}, 0), 1)
Bfb2 fb2 gnd V = min(max(v(bi2, gnd) / {logic}, 0), 1)
Rfa1 fa1 gnd 1Meg
Rfa2 fa2 gnd 1Meg
Rfb1 fb1 gnd 1Meg
Rfb2 fb2 gnd 1Meg
* Each output is the switch averaged over the time it is driven (pd = ph + pl): VM for
* the share d = ph / pd of that time, 0 V for the rest, behind the on resistances (exact
* for a continuous current); its current comes from VM for d and from ground for 1 - d.
Bpd_ao1 pd_ao1 gnd V = v(en)*v(fa1)*(1-v(fa2)) + v(en)*v(fa2)
Bd_ao1 d_ao1 gnd V = min(v(en)*v(fa1)*(1-v(fa2)) / max(v(pd_ao1), 1e-6), 1)
Rpd_ao1 pd_ao1 gnd 1Meg
Rd_ao1 d_ao1 gnd 1Meg
Bh_ao1 vm ao1 I = v(d_ao1) * v(pd_ao1) * (v(d_ao1) * v(vm, gnd) - v(ao1, gnd)) / (v(d_ao1) * {rhs} + (1 - v(d_ao1)) * {rls})
Bl_ao1 gnd ao1 I = (1 - v(d_ao1)) * v(pd_ao1) * (v(d_ao1) * v(vm, gnd) - v(ao1, gnd)) / (v(d_ao1) * {rhs} + (1 - v(d_ao1)) * {rls})
Bpd_ao2 pd_ao2 gnd V = v(en)*v(fa2)*(1-v(fa1)) + v(en)*v(fa1)
Bd_ao2 d_ao2 gnd V = min(v(en)*v(fa2)*(1-v(fa1)) / max(v(pd_ao2), 1e-6), 1)
Rpd_ao2 pd_ao2 gnd 1Meg
Rd_ao2 d_ao2 gnd 1Meg
Bh_ao2 vm ao2 I = v(d_ao2) * v(pd_ao2) * (v(d_ao2) * v(vm, gnd) - v(ao2, gnd)) / (v(d_ao2) * {rhs} + (1 - v(d_ao2)) * {rls})
Bl_ao2 gnd ao2 I = (1 - v(d_ao2)) * v(pd_ao2) * (v(d_ao2) * v(vm, gnd) - v(ao2, gnd)) / (v(d_ao2) * {rhs} + (1 - v(d_ao2)) * {rls})
Bpd_bo1 pd_bo1 gnd V = v(en)*v(fb1)*(1-v(fb2)) + v(en)*v(fb2)
Bd_bo1 d_bo1 gnd V = min(v(en)*v(fb1)*(1-v(fb2)) / max(v(pd_bo1), 1e-6), 1)
Rpd_bo1 pd_bo1 gnd 1Meg
Rd_bo1 d_bo1 gnd 1Meg
Bh_bo1 vm bo1 I = v(d_bo1) * v(pd_bo1) * (v(d_bo1) * v(vm, gnd) - v(bo1, gnd)) / (v(d_bo1) * {rhs} + (1 - v(d_bo1)) * {rls})
Bl_bo1 gnd bo1 I = (1 - v(d_bo1)) * v(pd_bo1) * (v(d_bo1) * v(vm, gnd) - v(bo1, gnd)) / (v(d_bo1) * {rhs} + (1 - v(d_bo1)) * {rls})
Bpd_bo2 pd_bo2 gnd V = v(en)*v(fb2)*(1-v(fb1)) + v(en)*v(fb1)
Bd_bo2 d_bo2 gnd V = min(v(en)*v(fb2)*(1-v(fb1)) / max(v(pd_bo2), 1e-6), 1)
Rpd_bo2 pd_bo2 gnd 1Meg
Rd_bo2 d_bo2 gnd 1Meg
Bh_bo2 vm bo2 I = v(d_bo2) * v(pd_bo2) * (v(d_bo2) * v(vm, gnd) - v(bo2, gnd)) / (v(d_bo2) * {rhs} + (1 - v(d_bo2)) * {rls})
Bl_bo2 gnd bo2 I = (1 - v(d_bo2)) * v(pd_bo2) * (v(d_bo2) * v(vm, gnd) - v(bo2, gnd)) / (v(d_bo2) * {rhs} + (1 - v(d_bo2)) * {rls})
* Body diodes of the output FETs
Dha1 ao1 vm dbody
Dla1 gnd ao1 dbody
Dha2 ao2 vm dbody
Dla2 gnd ao2 dbody
Dhb1 bo1 vm dbody
Dlb1 gnd bo1 dbody
Dhb2 bo2 vm dbody
Dlb2 gnd bo2 dbody
.model dbody D(IS=1e-12 N=1.3 RS=0.05)
Rao1 ao1 gnd 10Meg
Rao2 ao2 gnd 10Meg
Rbo1 bo1 gnd 10Meg
Rbo2 bo2 gnd 10Meg
* Supply current: 1.7 mA awake, 1.6 uA asleep.
Biq vm gnd I = 1.7m * v(en) * min(max(v(vm, gnd) / 2, 0), 1)
Rq vm gnd 3Meg
.ends eda_drv8833
